# Demo only. There is no database and no object-storage bucket.
#
# Stage 01 reads queries/images.sql to show the extract shape, then loads
# MNIST from torchvision.datasets.MNIST. The SQL text is never sent to a server.
#
# The DVC remote "demo" is the local directory dvc-remote/ (see .dvc/config).
# Copy this file to .env before `make dvc-push`. That target passes --env-file .env.
#
# Optional. Pin a local checkpoint and skip the DVC download.
# MNIST_AE_MODEL=
#
# Optional. Git branch, tag, or commit for the DVC download. Unset uses the default branch.
# MNIST_AE_REV=
#
# Optional. Directory for the md5 checkpoint cache. Unset uses the user cache directory.
# MNIST_AE_CACHE=
#
# Optional. Git repo dvc.api clones. Unset uses this template repo.
# MNIST_AE_REPO=
#
# An s3:// remote needs these. The demo remote is a local directory, so leave them empty.
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
